li + li   An <li> immediately following another <li>
li ~ li   All <li> elements following another <li> (not necessarily immediately)
ul li     All <li> elements inside a <ul>, at any depth
ul > li   Only <li> elements directly inside a <ul>
ul, ol    Both <ul> and <ol> elements


Easy way to remember
, = OR (select multiple things)
~ = any following sibling
+ = immediately next sibling
> = direct child
(space) = descendant


